msgid "Enter who was paid."
msgstr "किसे भुगतान किया, वह लिखें।"

#: apps/expenses/services.py:34
msgid "This event is closed. Money records cannot be added or changed."
msgstr "यह कार्यक्रम बंद है। पैसों के रिकॉर्ड जोड़े या बदले नहीं जा सकते।"

#: apps/expenses/services.py:41
msgid "The date cannot be in the future."
